.nh
.TH containers-storage-dedup 1 "November 2024"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
containers-storage-dedup \- Deduplicate similar files in the images

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBcontainers-storage\fP \fBdedup\fP

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Find similar files in the images and deduplicate them.  It requires reflink support from the file system.

.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB--hash-method\fP \fImethod\fP

.PP
Specify the function to use to calculate the hash for a file.  It can be one of: \fIsize\fP, \fIcrc\fP, \fIsha256sum\fP\&.

.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
containers-storage dedup
.EE
